{
  "basis": "The dashboard displays a five-point scatterplot (Weeks 7-11) showing a positive association between advertising spend and sales. However, the chart lacks a control group, cost/margin data, or causal analysis to demonstrate that the spend itself drove the sales or that the increase is financially justified. Given the absence of profitability or causal validation, the evidence is insufficient to support a broader budget increase, making a hold for full-data analysis the appropriate decision.",
  "option_label": "Select 'Hold and request full-data analysis'"
}
